# Vault Obsidian

- Knowledge in `vault/` is always **English**.
- Keep structure: `00-index`, `10-architecture`, `20-domains`, `30-services`, `40-frontends`, `50-operations`, `60-security`, `70-changelogs`, `90-references`.
- Use Obsidian-friendly wikilinks, tags (`#service`, `#adr`, `#feature`), and folder notes — avoid dumping loose files at vault root.
- After each implemented feature: add/update domain/service notes + entry in `vault/70-changelogs/`.
- Map new functionality so future Specs do not start from zero.
